cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use RimBank in research or teaching, please cite it as below."
title: "RimBank: an open-source core banking platform implementing BIAN v14"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "RimBank contributors"
  - family-names: "Said"
    given-names: "LaBani"
    alias: "KsiProgramming"
repository-code: "https://github.com/KsiProgramming/RimBank"
abstract: >-
  RimBank is an open-source core banking platform built in .NET that implements the
  BIAN Service Landscape v14 using Domain-Driven Design, event sourcing and hexagonal
  architecture. Every capability is exposed both as a BIAN HTTP API and as a Model
  Context Protocol tool for AI agents.
keywords:
  - core banking
  - BIAN
  - domain-driven design
  - event sourcing
  - hexagonal architecture
  - .NET
  - Model Context Protocol
license: MIT
